      "widgets_values": [
        "CRUN NEXT — SAFE START\n\nThis workflow defaults to PREPARE: no API request, upload or charge.\nEnter your API key only through Settings > CRUN Next, never in a workflow.\nConnect Load Image to native IMAGE references, or use Advanced URL fallbacks. Arrays/objects use JSON.\nPREPARE stays local. ESTIMATE uploads connected references and requests a price. GENERATE uploads references and submits a paid task.\nThe optional credit cap is under Advanced: 0 disables it; a positive cap is respected. Review the visible quote receipt.\nDo not share private media links when publishing this workflow.\n\nOption: Qwen Image 2 Pro - Text to Image\nModel: qwen-image-2.0-pro\nDocumentation: https://docs.crun.ai/models/qwen/qwen-image-2-pro\n"
